id: FEND20-6
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: state_paths
target: crates/web/src/persist.rs
find: install_save_on_leave(key, crate::glue::history_to_save)
replace: EngineHost::open_history(&mut host, &[]); install_save_on_leave(key, crate::glue::history_to_save)
expect-fail: 層全体は_update_を通らない状態の変更を持たない
note: UFCS 形式（EngineHost::method(&mut host, ..)）の状態変更が保存の層に入る（R3 の許可表。FEND20-3 の UFCS 版）
